      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Acupuncture points were exposed to helium-neon laser beam in 200 anginal patients. This therapeutic modality yielded good results: the number of attacks and nitroglycerin intake reduced, exercise tolerance grew, echocardiographic evidence showed a positive trend, hemodynamics improved, Spilberger's test values changed for the better."},
